    <title>Scatter Architecture: ScatterField, Forest, and RockField</title>
    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><anchor id="md_docs_2content_2dev_2scatter__field_1autotoc_md40"/> This document details the uniform scattering architecture in HighMap, describing the relationship between the base <computeroutput>ScatterField</computeroutput> container and its domain-specific specializations: <computeroutput>Forest</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>RockField</computeroutput>.</para>
<sect1 id="md_docs_2content_2dev_2scatter__field_1autotoc_md41">
